								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=810"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10583#msg10583"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10583#msg10583">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #33 on:</b> August 28, 2004, 02:49:58 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I have a little list:<br /><br /><b>Azzabar </b> (retired) who drew me into EQ by refusing to come to the dinner table because of Hate raids, so I had to find out what EQ was all about.  Then proceeded to pound the rules of play into my head.<br /><br /><b>Zizx</b> (retired)  the patient, who calmly interpreted what Azzabar was pounding me about.<br /><br /><b>Ubilaar</b> the sweet, who farmed EE bags and gave me plat all the time<br /><br /><b>Tenril </b> (retired) and <b>Oneiron</b> for hours upon hours of grinding those levels only to have 5 more added as we saw our exp. bar about to reach 60.<br /><br /><b>Daarksun</b> for completing my EQ education and keeping me interested in the game....and those &quot;just 15 minutes&quot; and &quot;NaMeDs&quot; tells to keep me playing til 6 am....<br /><br />After 4+ years I have a long list of people I&#039;ve spent time exploring with and only a short list on /ignore.  Some of you I run into here and there (/wave and /hugs), many I never see any more.   The day I made the first toon I never imagined all the great people I&#039;d meet and the fun I&#039;d have along the way.<br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Dyaan Truesite<br />Hegemony<br />Recruit Officer/Guild Commander<br /><br />You can&#039;t scare me, I have children!
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10586"></a>
