								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blushing.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								OMG Weeee!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=219"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:shyranphyton@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10586#msg10586"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10586#msg10586">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #34 on:</b> August 28, 2004, 05:08:49 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ugglus/Psychadel--RL friend who brought this habbit to our home <br />Eshebala and Slugga--My first guildleaders back when I hit lvl 10<br />Kelce--Leader of MV and damn good rogue.<br />Strumph--My partner in crime and mentor.<br />Cubpaws--Always learning, always striving to be the best player she could be.<br />Domaris, Yile, Cudget and Deif.--for being so cool and fun in RL and reminding me that the real people behind the toons are what make this game so addictive!<br /><br />Dissonant, Ysababe, Vosh--for putting up with the ranger-duo, I don&#039;t know how you guys do it! /salute<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
