	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10937"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=801" title="View the profile of Diggins">Diggins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 12<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/Cheschirecat.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=801"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10937#msg10937"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10937#msg10937">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #35 on:</b> September 08, 2004, 07:15:18 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Valthon/Drozan, RL bud who brought his eq disc to my house and forced me to roll a char on his account to try it out.&nbsp; I didn&#039;t want to play any geeky rp game but when my computer HD crashed...I went out and bought the game for myself.<br /><br />Tatyana, a druid I met in Unrest who taught me alot about group play and roles classes played in a group.&nbsp; Kept me alive, dont think I ever died when grouped with her.&nbsp; Took me on my first trip to CT.&nbsp; We tried to take on orthilus or some such the orc guy in so ro who conned yellow but almost smoked us both on that trip.<br /><br />Wixramiablo, this guy was the one Rogue who I actually got nervous grouping with, like he was some sort of celebrity.&nbsp; He gave me my first poison one day in oasis, then went invis with a &quot;poof&quot; macro, man there weren&#039;t that many Rogues around back then and definately none as cool as that.<br /><br />Lots of old timers I used to play with whose names I cannot remember now.<br /><br />Alot of people in HoN and EiE the only two guilds I really consider having belonged to (even if they don&#039;t&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />&nbsp; )
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Diggs
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11432"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=861" title="View the profile of Hannabel Voltaire">Hannabel Voltaire</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 1<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/view.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=861"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg11432#msg11432"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg11432#msg11432">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #36 on:</b> September 26, 2004, 05:46:25 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							After playing for 5 years, I &#039;retired&#039; back in June, 2004.&nbsp; However, the impact felt by various people still carries through to this day.&nbsp; I often think back upon the fun times and a few of the havoc induced crazed periods.<br /><br />Dyaan - Witty, insightful, and just a downright sweet lady.<br /><br />Aislynne - Perhaps the best woman that I ever got to know and respect.<br /><br />Bigtoxic - Vile, vulgar, and full of crap.. and that was his good-side&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Serepi - The exact opposite to me..the sugar to my vinegar. <br /><br />Zinne and Faylana - &quot;Baby sisters&quot; They gave me encouragement when others just wanted to ride my ass (that&#039;s not easy to do when your main is a high elf male <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm20.gif" alt="cwm20" border="0" />)<br /><br />Kindo and Thad - RL friends that always provided encouragement in life and in game.&nbsp; Cheers to them.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Umm..yeah..something something..blah blah blah..etc etc ...<br />The Check is in the mail, I promise!
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
